1. **D3 Treemap Algorithm**: Converts standard JSON objects into custom nested rectangles. Cell sizes remain bounded relative to their market cap.
2. **GPU-Accelerated Pan/Zoom**: The zoom functionality applies standard CSS 2D matrix transformations (`translate`, `scale`) onto a single graphical `<g>` layer. This guarantees high 60fps responsiveness, even with thousands of rendering nodes.
3. **CSS Color Interpolations**: Instead of using heavy JS layout animations, color shifts use a standard GPU CSS transitions library (`transition: fill 0.5s ease`). This avoids bottlenecking the browser thread during high-frequency real-time updates.

