### Project Architecture & Data Flow

```text
 [ User A Browser ]               [ Node.js Backend Server ]               [ User B Browser ]
     |                                        |                                        |
     |--- Drag task to "In Progress" ------>  | (Receives state update)                |
     |                                        |--- Broadcasts updated state -------->  |
     |                                        |                                        | (Board UI updates 
     |<-- Confirms broadcast -----------------|                                        |  instantly)
```

