2. **Lock-Free Pipeline:** We use `crossbeam-channel` (an extremely fast, lock-free multi-producer, multi-consumer queue system) instead of heavy OS mutexes.
3. **Sampling-Based Latency Monitoring:** Measuring time (`Instant::now()`) on *every* single message at 10M+ msg/s creates system-call overhead. We use systematic sampling (e.g., 1 out of every 10 messages) to track precise latency down to nanoseconds without degrading throughput.
