    // 2. Apply Low-Pass Exponential Moving Average (EMA) Filter
    // Formula: Y[n] = Y[n-1] + ((X[n] - Y[n-1]) / 2^Shift)
    // Division is replaced with a right bit-shift (>>), which executes in 1 CPU cycle.
