4. **Hysteresis Protection:** By keeping `ACTUATOR_LOW_THRES` (52.0) lower than `ACTUATOR_HIGH_THRES` (62.0), the actuator will not rapidly switch on and off (which wastes power and damages physical switches) if the sensor reading oscillates around 60.

