To respect the "resource-constrained" requirement, this design uses **zero dynamic memory allocation (no heap/`alloc`)**, runs with **deterministic $O(1)$ time and space complexity**, and uses a lightweight **Exponential Moving Average (EMA) filter** (which is computationally cheap and requires only a single float of memory).

