2. **Dynamic Phong Lighting Model**: The Fragment shader computes dynamic lighting in real-time. If you rotate the view or watch the light orbit, the diffuse shadows and shiny, intense specular highlights recalculate on every single frame per pixel.
3. **Orbit Controls**: Fully interactive mouse orbiting and zooming.
4. **Distance Attenuation**: Implements real-world inverse-square-like falloff behavior (the light loses intensity the further away it moves from parts of the mesh).

