This implementation uses **Symplectic Euler integration**, an **impulse-based sequential solver** for circle-to-circle and circle-to-boundary collisions (with penetration correction to prevent sinking), and a **deterministic fixed-timestep accumulator loop** (the industry-standard "Fix Your Timestep" algorithm) to ensure the simulation runs identically regardless of hardware speed or frame rate.

